A bank provides personal loans to customers. Some customers fail to repay their loans.
The bank wants to develop a Deep Learning system that predicts whether a new applicant has a high probability of defaulting on the loan.
This prediction will help the bank assess risk before approving loans.

Dataset
Feature	        Description
Age	            Applicant age
Income	        Annual income
LoanAmount	    Requested loan
CreditScore	    Credit score
EmploymentYears	Years employed
ExistingLoans	  Number of existing loans
MonthlyDebt	    Existing monthly debt
LoanTerm	      Loan duration
PreviousDefault	Yes/No
HomeOwnership	  Rent/Own/Mortgage
Default	0/1 —   Target


Build:  
Loan Default Prediction using Multi-Layer Perceptron

Output:  
0 → Low default risk
1 → High default risk


